# Normalise line endings in the repo to LF.
#
# Without this, files committed from Windows carry CRLF and every checkout on
# macOS/Linux shows the entire file as modified — 2932 changed lines that are
# purely invisible whitespace. That buries real diffs and makes review useless.
# Now working across a PC and a Mac, so this matters.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
